      "writtenOn": "2019-11-25T18:54:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s a good idea to fix this by assuming that an all 0\u0027s key is uninitialized, since a 1 in 2^64 chance isn\u0027t *that* unlikely, especially when there could be millions of files.  Can you add a separate ci_hash_key_initialized flag?",
